{
  "slug": "vibe-cartographer",
  "name": "Vibe Cartographer",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Vibe Cartographer turns the vibe-coding hype into a structured workflow. Eight commands walk you from idea spark to shipped app: a flipped-interaction onboarding (/onboard), a scope brainstorm (/scope), a PRD interview (/prd), a tech spec grounded in your architecture (/spec), a dependency-aware build checklist (/checklist), an autonomous-or-step-by-step build loop (/build), an optional polish pass (/iterate), and a real retrospective (/reflect). The agent picks up a unified builder profile at ~/.claude/profiles/builder.json so persona, pacing, and stack preferences carry across projects and across other 626Labs plugins. Three Level-3.5 self-evolution commands round it out: /evolve (the plugin reads its own logs and proposes improvements), /vitals (self-diagnostic health check), /friction (real-time friction capture for future evolve cycles).",
  "longDescription": "Installs with `claude plugin install vibe-cartographer@claude-community` from `estevanhernandez-stack-ed/vibe-cartographer`.\n\nPlot your course from idea to shipped app.\n\nVibe Cartographer turns the vibe-coding hype into a structured workflow. Eight commands walk you from idea spark to shipped app: a flipped-interaction onboarding (/onboard), a scope brainstorm (/scope), a PRD interview (/prd), a tech spec grounded in your architecture (/spec), a dependency-aware build checklist (/checklist), an autonomous-or-step-by-step build loop (/build), an optional polish pass (/iterate), and a real retrospective (/reflect). The agent picks up a unified builder profile at ~/.claude/profiles/builder.json so persona, pacing, and stack preferences carry across projects and across other 626Labs plugins. Three Level-3.5 self-evolution commands round it out: /evolve (the plugin reads its own logs and proposes improvements), /vitals (self-diagnostic health check), /friction (real-time friction capture for future evolve cycles).",
